      {
        "@value": "NADPH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + AA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + Malonyl-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] => DTA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + CoA-SH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + CO2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]"
