        "@value": "3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al is oxidized to 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate (THCA)"
      }
    ],
    "https://systemomicslab.github.io/MSLipidMapper/ontology/curationStatus": [
      {
