"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76183\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76183.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29666, \"displayName\": \"ACA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACA\", \"acetoacetate\", \"3-Oxobutanoate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10071934], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29666\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29666.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-6788597\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-6788597.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved Phy