        "@value": "H+ [cytosol] + NADPH [cytosol] + 14DMLANOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + O2 [cytosol] => H2O [cytosol] + NADP+ [cytosol] + 4C4MZYMOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]"
