", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10007151], \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10007151], \"dbId\": 29368, \"displayName\": \"O2 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"O2\", \"dioxygen\", \"Oxygen\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29368\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29368.6\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP46A1 24-hydroxylates CHOL\", \"cholesterol + O2 + reduced (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase) => (24S)-hydroxycholesterol + H(+) + H2O + oxidized (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase)\", \"cholesterol + NADPH + H+ + O2 => 24-hydroxycholesterol + NADP+ + H2O\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 192060, \"displayName\": \"24OH-CHOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"24OH-CHOL\", \"(24S)-24-hydroxycholesterol\", \"24-hydroxycholesterol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10007151], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192060\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192060.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29366, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10007151], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29356, \"displayName\": \"H2O [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10007151], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-192061\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-192061.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
