ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10007853, \"displayName\": \"CYP51A1 demethylates LAN\", \"followingEvent\": [10007862], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP51A1 demethylates LAN\", \"lanosterol + 3 O2 + 3 reduced (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase) => 4,4-dimethyl-5alpha-cholesta-8,14,24-trien-3beta-ol + formate + 4 H(+) + 4 H2O + 3 oxidized (NADPH--hemoprotein reductase)\", \"lanosterol + 3 NADPH + 3 H+ + 3 O2 => 4,4-dimethylcholesta-8(9),14,24-trien-3beta-ol + 3 NADP+ + 4 H2O + formate\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-194678\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-194678.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-194698\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-194698.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='