        "@value": "chenodeoxycholoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + Gly, TAU [peroxisomal matrix] => chenodeoxycholate bile salts [peroxisomal matrix] + H+ [peroxisomal matrix] + CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix]"
