        "@value": "PROP-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + ATP [mitochondrial matrix] + HCO3- [mitochondrial matrix] => ADP [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + MEMA-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + Pi [mitochondrial matrix]"
