is degraded to 12S-HHT and MDA by TBXAS1\", \"prostaglandin H2 => (12S)-hydroxy-(5Z,8E,10E)-heptadecatrienoate + malonaldehyde\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2142797, \"displayName\": \"12S-HHT [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"12S-HHT\", \"12(S)-HHTrE(1-)\", \"12S-HHTrE\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10048452], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2142797\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2142797.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 2161562, \"displayName\": \"MDA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"MDA\", \"malonaldehyde\", \"Malondialdehyde\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10048452], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-2161562\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-2161562.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 9999286, \"displayName\": \"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS1\", \"followingEvent\": [10048452], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS1\", \"AH2 + prostaglandin G2 = A + H2O + prostaglandin H2\", \"Peroxidative reduction of PGG2 to PGH2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-140359\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-140359.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10049911, \"displayName\": \"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS2\", \"followingEvent\": [10048452], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGG2 is reduced to PGH2 by PTGS2\", \"AH2 + prostaglandin G2 = A + H2O + prostaglandin H2\", \"Peroxidative reduction of PGG2 to PGH2\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-2309773\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-2309773.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-2161613\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-2161613.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org