sine 5'-triphosphate\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-5696069\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-5696069.4\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"AGK:Mg2+ phosphorylates MAG, DAG\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 5696037, \"displayName\": \"LPA,PA [mitochondrial intermembrane space]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"LPA,PA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10069885], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-5696037\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-5696037.1\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 5696026, \"displayName\": \"ADP [mitochondrial intermembrane space]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ADP\", \"ADP(3-)\", \"Adenosine 5'-diphosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10069885], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-5696026\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-5696026.4\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-5696074\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-5696074.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electr