        "@value": "Fe(2+)Cb5 [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol] + ST-CoA [cytosol] + O2 [cytosol] => H2O [cytosol] + Fe(3+)Cb5 [cytosol] + OLE-CoA [cytosol]"
