23644, \"displayName\": \"(18R)-resolvin E3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"(18R)-resolvin E3\", \"(18R)-resolvin E3(1-)\", \"18(R)-RvE3\", \"18(R) resolvin-E3\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10092472], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9023644\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9023644.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10092469, \"displayName\": \"GPX4-2 reduces 18(R)-HpEPE to 18(R)-HEPE\", \"followingEvent\": [10092472], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"GPX4-2 reduces 18(R)-HpEPE to 18(R)-HEPE\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9018895\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9018895.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9018907\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9018907.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a