tIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29368.6\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX12:Fe2+ oxidises DHA to 14(S)-Hp-DHA\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9025012, \"displayName\": \"14(S)-Hp-DHA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"14(S)-Hp-DHA\", \"(4Z,8E,10Z,12E,14S,16Z,19Z)-14-hydroperoxydocosahexaenoate\", \"14(S)-HpDHA(1-)\", \"(4Z,8E,10Z,12E,14S,16Z,19Z)-14-hydroperoxydocosahexaenoic acid\", \"14(S)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10092502], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9025012\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9025012.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"MMU\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48892, \"displayName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"name\": [\"Mus musculus\", \"M. musculus\", \"Mm\", \"house mouse\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10090\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Mus musculus\", \"stId\": \"R-MMU-9020274\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-MMU-9020274.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"Th