        "@value": "25(S) DHCA-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + O2 [peroxisomal matrix] => 25(S) 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholest-24-enoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + H2O2 [peroxisomal matrix]"
