      {
        "@value": "NAD+ [peroxisomal matrix] + (24R, 25R) 3a,7a,12a,24-tetrahydroxy-5b-cholestanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] => H+ [peroxisomal matrix] + NADH [peroxisomal matrix] + 3a,7a,12a-trihydroxy-5b-cholest-24-one-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]"
